1
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:40,800
[Her Willing Subject]

2
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:43,680
[Episode 1]

3
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:49,580
The Emperor of Dasheng is incompetent
and neglects state affairs.

4
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:53,000
Empress Shen Shuying
and Regent Lu Qingcang

5
00:00:53,170 --> 00:00:55,560
split the realm between them,
sworn enemies.

6
00:00:56,790 --> 00:00:58,490
But both are afflicted
by the Yin-Yang Gu poison.

7
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:01,460
Each is the other's antidote,
their lives bound as one,

8
00:01:01,910 --> 00:01:03,530
keeping a delicate balance.

9
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:12,920
Yet

10
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:15,430
the Emperor is dying,
and the balance breaks.

11
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,430
Shen Shuying receives a secret report:

12
00:01:17,710 --> 00:01:19,400
Lu Qingcang has colluded
with foreign enemies

13
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:20,510
and plans to rebel.

14
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:22,710
Shen Shuying decides

15
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:24,840
to strike first.

16
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:28,040
Speak up!
How is Her Majesty?

17
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:31,510
Her Majesty's chronic heart
ailment is extremely rare.

18
00:01:31,510 --> 00:01:33,680
No... no medicine can cure it!

19
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:36,560
Your Majesty!

20
00:01:37,710 --> 00:01:38,510
Your Majesty!

21
00:01:38,510 --> 00:01:39,760
His Majesty is failing.

22
00:01:39,950 --> 00:01:41,280
We ask that the imperial
physician be sent over.

23
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:43,560
Can't you see Her Majesty
is unwell?

24
00:01:43,590 --> 00:01:45,280
Every imperial physician
must stay and treat her.

25
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:48,400
Fail to cure her, and you
can forget your heads.

26
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:50,920
Y-Your Majesty, spare us!

27
00:01:51,590 --> 00:01:52,400
Your Majesty...

28
00:01:56,480 --> 00:01:58,760
[Shen Shuying,
Empress of Dasheng]

29
00:01:58,760 --> 00:01:59,710
My medicine,

30
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:01,510
has it arrived?

31
00:02:13,310 --> 00:02:13,910
Who goes there,

32
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,240
daring to ride a horse into the city?

33
00:02:15,910 --> 00:02:16,560
Light the fire!

34
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:26,720
[Lu Qingcang,
Regent of Dasheng]

35
00:02:27,750 --> 00:02:28,800
Greetings, Your Highness.

36
00:02:42,150 --> 00:02:43,470
I can cure Her Majesty's

37
00:02:43,710 --> 00:02:44,710
heart ailment.

38
00:02:45,590 --> 00:02:47,470
Everyone knows the Regent of Dasheng

39
00:02:47,470 --> 00:02:49,240
is at odds with Her Majesty.

40
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,560
[Lingxi, Golden Armor Guard Chief]
Would you really be so kind?

41
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:51,960
Stand down.

42
00:02:52,750 --> 00:02:53,560
Your Majesty...

43
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:58,080
All of you, stand down.

44
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:00,240
Th-Thank you, Your Majesty.

45
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:38,960
You're late.

46
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:40,310
Does it hurt?

47
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,870
I can't bear it any longer.

48
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:16,240
The whole court thinks
you and I are rivals.

49
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:18,510
Who would have thought

50
00:04:19,270 --> 00:04:21,270
we would be so entangled?

51
00:04:21,430 --> 00:04:24,510
Between us, it's only because
of the Yin-Yang Gu.

52
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:26,630
We are merely each other's antidote.

53
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,630
If not for the poison binding us

54
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,360
in shared life and death,

55
00:04:32,950 --> 00:04:34,430
wouldn't Your Majesty

56
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:36,390
be eager to have me killed?

57
00:04:39,070 --> 00:04:40,310
Don't you want to?

58
00:04:45,310 --> 00:04:47,000
Then if I win the realm,

59
00:04:47,310 --> 00:04:48,920
would you be willing to be with me?

60
00:04:56,510 --> 00:04:58,000
What a ridiculous joke.

61
00:04:58,120 --> 00:05:00,120
I am of the royal house.
You are a traitor.

62
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:02,120
If you dare to rebel,

63
00:05:02,190 --> 00:05:03,630
I will surely execute you.

64
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:07,720
Now you and I
each hold half the realm.

65
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:08,950
If we keep fighting like this,

66
00:05:08,950 --> 00:05:10,480
we will only destroy each other.

67
00:05:12,390 --> 00:05:13,360
Not necessarily.

68
00:05:13,750 --> 00:05:15,070
After tonight,

69
00:05:15,430 --> 00:05:17,120
I will rule from behind the curtain

70
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:19,000
and become Queen of the realm.

71
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:22,830
You will go guard the border.

72
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:23,830
What do you mean?

73
00:05:25,390 --> 00:05:27,040
You had me come here
in the name of curing the poison

74
00:05:27,630 --> 00:05:29,160
just to lure me away!

75
00:05:30,950 --> 00:05:32,510
You only just realized?

76
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,600
Not too slow.

77
00:05:33,830 --> 00:05:34,950
But it's too late.

78
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:37,000
Not a single imperial physician
went to treat the Emperor.

79
00:05:37,070 --> 00:05:38,480
He won't survive the night.

80
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:49,510
The world

81
00:05:50,750 --> 00:05:52,000
is about to change.

82
00:05:55,920 --> 00:06:00,270
His Majesty has passed away!

83
00:06:07,390 --> 00:06:08,680
Golden Armor Guard,
hear my command!

84
00:06:08,950 --> 00:06:10,040
The Emperor has passed away.

85
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:11,720
By order of Her Majesty,

86
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:13,750
the Golden Armor Guard will
defend the palace to the death!

87
00:06:13,830 --> 00:06:16,000
All orders except those from
the Empress at Cining Hall

88
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:16,920
are hereby abolished!

89
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,310
If anyone exploits the chaos
to rebel,

90
00:06:18,310 --> 00:06:20,190
from high officials down to
commoners,

91
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,680
kill them on sight!

92
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:22,680
Kill!

93
00:06:22,870 --> 00:06:23,600
Kill!

94
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:24,600
Kill!

95
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,920
So you had this planned all along.

96
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:29,630
It seems tonight

97
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:31,830
is truly a night of endless drama.

98
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:34,190
Give up the title of Regent,

99
00:06:34,190 --> 00:06:36,000
hand over the Iron Cavalry's
tiger tally,

100
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:37,630
and I will spare your life.

101
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,190
After all,

102
00:06:40,870 --> 00:06:43,480
I still need you alive
to cure the Yin-Yang Gu.

103
00:06:44,950 --> 00:06:46,480
Are you so certain

104
00:06:46,480 --> 00:06:48,360
you can hold the throne?

105
00:06:50,430 --> 00:06:52,630
The Emperor, Xiao Ningze,
was incompetent and tyrannical.

106
00:06:52,630 --> 00:06:55,430
All court affairs, inside and out,
I have handled on my own.

107
00:06:55,870 --> 00:06:58,390
The Golden Armor Guard answers
to me alone.

108
00:06:58,870 --> 00:07:00,360
Though I am a woman,

109
00:07:00,630 --> 00:07:02,000
the people are with me.

110
00:07:02,310 --> 00:07:03,830
Why shouldn't I?

111
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:06,800
Then where does that leave
my Iron Cavalry?

112
00:07:10,430 --> 00:07:11,390
You came here,

113
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,750
while your deputy Zhuren
went to the palace!

114
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:19,480
By

115
00:07:20,310 --> 00:07:21,680
order of the Regent!

116
00:07:22,070 --> 00:07:23,560
[Zhuren, Iron Cavalry Deputy General]
If anyone rebels,

117
00:07:23,950 --> 00:07:25,000
the Iron Cavalry

118
00:07:25,310 --> 00:07:27,720
will kill without mercy!

119
00:07:34,750 --> 00:07:37,480
The Golden Armor Guard will
protect Her Majesty to the death!

120
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:39,920
Kill!

121
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:16,430
Shen Shuying,

122
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:19,120
I can endure everything else,

123
00:08:20,430 --> 00:08:22,160
but you framed me for treason,

124
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:24,430
and that has crossed my bottom line.

125
00:08:24,510 --> 00:08:25,720
The guilty one cries foul first.

126
00:08:25,830 --> 00:08:27,310
You are the one who wants the throne.

127
00:08:30,190 --> 00:08:31,000
Fine.

128
00:08:31,310 --> 00:08:32,720
One mountain cannot hold two tigers.

129
00:08:32,790 --> 00:08:34,000
It seems between you and me,

130
00:08:34,030 --> 00:08:36,080
only one can make it to the end.

131
00:08:38,670 --> 00:08:40,150
I will report to the Regent.

132
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,720
The palace is secured!

133
00:08:45,270 --> 00:08:47,270
That person will not be you.

134
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:01,200
Bone-Eroding Powder?

135
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:04,000
You poisoned me!

136
00:09:04,910 --> 00:09:06,910
I only kept it as a backup.

137
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,240
Now it seems

138
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,630
I was right to keep it.

139
00:09:13,270 --> 00:09:16,200
The Yin-Yang Gu binds our lives.
Kill me,

140
00:09:17,550 --> 00:09:18,750
and you die too.

141
00:09:19,750 --> 00:09:21,030
Once you take the throne,

142
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:23,120
you will wipe out my tens of
thousands of men.

143
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:25,480
It has come this far.
There is no turning back.

144
00:09:25,750 --> 00:09:28,550
And for me, Shen Shuying, to be
your caged bird

145
00:09:28,550 --> 00:09:29,790
and wallow in the mire with you,

146
00:09:29,790 --> 00:09:31,150
how is that different from death?

147
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:32,910
Then we might as well

148
00:09:34,030 --> 00:09:35,910
both die together.

149
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:22,960
Lu Qingcang.

150
00:10:23,790 --> 00:10:25,480
To break this Yin-Yang Gu bond,

151
00:10:26,150 --> 00:10:27,670
I once sought a mystic.

152
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:29,670
The mystic said

153
00:10:30,030 --> 00:10:31,150
this is no poison,

154
00:10:31,630 --> 00:10:32,440
it is fate.

155
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:34,630
There is no cure.

156
00:10:36,030 --> 00:10:38,870
We two ill-fated stars are doomed
to clash and to cling,

157
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:40,720
in life and in death.

158
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:48,750
Young Master.

159
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:53,670
Archers, ready!

160
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:57,550
It seems he was right.

161
00:10:58,910 --> 00:11:00,360
Fire!

162
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:00,600
My Lady.

163
00:12:01,390 --> 00:12:02,200
My Lady.

164
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:16,870
Whatever it is, report calmly.

165
00:12:17,150 --> 00:12:20,030
What is all this panic about?

166
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:22,080
The Northern Liang campaign
was a great victory.

167
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:24,670
The Chancellor orders the whole
family to welcome the troops.

168
00:12:24,790 --> 00:12:25,840
We will be late.

169
00:12:26,030 --> 00:12:26,720
Father?

170
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:29,320
Didn't he die long ago?

171
00:12:30,670 --> 00:12:32,750
What treasonous words
are you speaking?

172
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:34,870
The Chancellor is already
waiting at the city gate.

173
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:36,200
If you are late, My Lady,

174
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:38,000
the Chancellor will be furious.

175
00:12:54,480 --> 00:12:57,390
It is now the 7th year of Yongxi?

176
00:13:02,550 --> 00:13:03,960
I have been reborn.

177
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:07,280
[Shen Shuying, Chancellor's Daughter]

178
00:13:07,280 --> 00:13:09,200
I am still the young lady of
the Chancellor's house.

179
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:12,120
Lu Qingcang is trapped at the border.

180
00:13:12,270 --> 00:13:13,720
The Shen house has not been raided.

181
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:16,440
I have not yet been cursed
with the Yin-Yang Gu.

182
00:13:18,240 --> 00:13:20,750
There is still time for everything.

183
00:13:20,750 --> 00:13:21,840
There is no time.

184
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,910
Everyone in the Shen house has
gone to the city gate.

185
00:13:25,550 --> 00:13:26,720
Everyone?

186
00:13:45,670 --> 00:13:46,790
You two, go over there!

187
00:13:46,790 --> 00:13:47,150
Yes.

188
00:13:47,150 --> 00:13:48,390
You two, over there!

189
00:13:48,390 --> 00:13:49,120
Yes.

190
00:13:49,790 --> 00:13:50,790
Search every corner.

191
00:13:53,510 --> 00:13:56,080
Chancellor Shen Qingsong is guilty
of colluding with the enemy

192
00:13:57,630 --> 00:13:58,720
and plotting treason!

193
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,030
Father!

194
00:14:12,790 --> 00:14:13,600
It seems

195
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:16,440
not everyone went to the city gate.

196
00:14:17,670 --> 00:14:19,000
So it's you, My Lady.

197
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:22,630
Is there something you can't show?

198
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:24,390
No.

199
00:14:24,750 --> 00:14:26,030
These are matters for grown-ups.

200
00:14:26,150 --> 00:14:27,360
You wouldn't understand, My Lady.

201
00:14:28,750 --> 00:14:29,790
My Lady, we should hurry...

202
00:14:35,630 --> 00:14:36,270
My Lady.

203
00:14:41,630 --> 00:14:42,750
You came at the right time.

204
00:14:43,030 --> 00:14:44,440
You came at just the right time.

205
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:46,870
C-Clean it up?

206
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:48,120
Me?

207
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:51,630
[From the Wolf King's Camp]
Didn't we buy a dog in the yard?

208
00:14:53,030 --> 00:14:54,150
Feed it to the dog.

209
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:03,510
Best get used to it early.

210
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:06,240
There will be plenty more
of this to come.

211
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:12,360
In my past life, the Shen house
was framed,

212
00:15:12,510 --> 00:15:13,790
and I bore the injustice.

213
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:15,270
Though I became Empress still,

214
00:15:15,550 --> 00:15:16,550
time was not on my side.

215
00:15:16,550 --> 00:15:18,200
I was always one step
from the throne.

216
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:19,080
In this life,

217
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:20,600
now that I know what comes,

218
00:15:20,750 --> 00:15:22,550
I can go straight for
Empress's throne.

219
00:15:22,630 --> 00:15:25,120
The realm is within my grasp.

220
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:34,440
[Dasheng Border Private Army]
What use is risking death for merit?

221
00:15:35,030 --> 00:15:36,240
Someone above has bought your life.

222
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:37,600
You want to return to
the capital in glory?

223
00:15:37,750 --> 00:15:38,750
In your next life.

224
00:15:39,030 --> 00:15:39,840
Do it.

225
00:15:44,790 --> 00:15:46,870
Isn't this the private prison where,
ten years ago, villains ambushed me

226
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:49,030
[Lu Qingcang, Border General]
and I nearly died?

227
00:15:49,030 --> 00:15:50,150
How did I end up back here?

228
00:15:50,440 --> 00:15:51,840
Play dead with me in a moment.

229
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:53,480
I won't hit anything vital.

230
00:16:17,030 --> 00:16:17,750
Speak.

231
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,390
Who wants me dead?

232
00:16:19,600 --> 00:16:20,790
I was only following orders.

233
00:16:20,910 --> 00:16:21,910
But since it has come to this,

234
00:16:21,910 --> 00:16:23,630
kill me or cut me down,
do what you will!

235
00:16:23,630 --> 00:16:25,120
Winner takes all. I accept.

236
00:16:25,320 --> 00:16:26,600
From now on, you follow me.

237
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:27,870
Zhuren.

238
00:16:30,440 --> 00:16:31,240
What,

239
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:33,030
you won't?

240
00:16:34,910 --> 00:16:36,240
At your command, General.

241
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:38,240
Back to the capital.

242
00:16:39,840 --> 00:16:41,320
I've actually been reborn.

243
00:16:41,550 --> 00:16:43,440
In my last life, Zhuren saved me,

244
00:16:43,440 --> 00:16:45,000
and I barely kept my life.

245
00:16:45,240 --> 00:16:46,150
This time,

246
00:16:46,390 --> 00:16:48,480
nothing will stop my triumphant
return to the capital.

247
00:16:48,600 --> 00:16:49,510
Shen Shuying,

248
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:52,270
it seems our ill-fated bond
is not yet over.

249
00:16:55,550 --> 00:16:56,360
Excuse me.

250
00:16:57,360 --> 00:16:58,270
Move aside, please.

251
00:16:59,360 --> 00:17:00,670
Move aside, please.

252
00:17:03,360 --> 00:17:04,030
Father.

253
00:17:04,030 --> 00:17:05,520
[Shen Qingsong, Chancellor of Dasheng]

254
00:17:05,520 --> 00:17:06,750
I told you to come early.

255
00:17:06,750 --> 00:17:07,920
Why are you only here now?

256
00:17:08,200 --> 00:17:10,440
A few small matters delayed me.

257
00:17:10,440 --> 00:17:12,440
Here he comes! General Lu is back!

258
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:14,110
General Lu!

259
00:17:14,590 --> 00:17:16,680
General Lu!

260
00:17:16,880 --> 00:17:18,830
General Lu!

261
00:17:38,270 --> 00:17:39,240
Lu Qingcang?

262
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:41,400
Wasn't he trapped at the border?

263
00:17:47,830 --> 00:17:50,880
Shen Shuying?
Her family wasn't confiscated?

264
00:18:05,640 --> 00:18:06,440
Qingcang.

265
00:18:06,790 --> 00:18:07,510
Chancellor.

266
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:08,720
No need for courtesy.

267
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:11,920
This is my daughter, Shen Shuying.

268
00:18:23,750 --> 00:18:25,120
Greetings, General Lu.

269
00:18:25,360 --> 00:18:26,880
Miss Shen, a pleasure.

270
00:18:30,190 --> 00:18:31,400
You are indeed well matched.

271
00:18:34,080 --> 00:18:34,670
Father.

272
00:18:34,910 --> 00:18:35,990
What kind of joke is this?

273
00:18:35,990 --> 00:18:37,600
How is this a joke?

274
00:18:37,840 --> 00:18:39,840
Qingcang's father, Lu Yuanshan, and I

275
00:18:39,840 --> 00:18:41,230
have been friends for many years.

276
00:18:41,230 --> 00:18:43,880
We settled your betrothal long ago.

277
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:44,950
Now

278
00:18:45,270 --> 00:18:47,950
Qingcang has won merit and
returned in triumph.

279
00:18:48,320 --> 00:18:51,640
It seems time to arrange
your wedding.

280
00:18:54,950 --> 00:18:56,640
In my last life,
the marriage fell through.

281
00:18:57,080 --> 00:18:58,560
I've forgotten all about it.

282
00:18:59,670 --> 00:19:00,800
Absurd.

283
00:19:17,040 --> 00:19:21,250
♪Moonlight spills over your
hand that holds the lantern♪

284
00:19:21,810 --> 00:19:26,030
♪Light and shadow chase
across the red wall♪

285
00:19:26,450 --> 00:19:30,660
♪Past entanglements,
how do we settle the score♪

286
00:19:31,160 --> 00:19:33,240
♪If fate turns once more♪

287
00:19:33,630 --> 00:19:36,090
♪Will our endings trade places♪

288
00:19:36,320 --> 00:19:41,000
♪Restraint or drawing near♪

289
00:19:41,110 --> 00:19:45,200
♪Tugging back and forth between
two hearts in resonance♪

290
00:19:45,740 --> 00:19:49,250
♪What tone should I take♪

291
00:19:49,360 --> 00:19:52,360
♪To leave no trace♪

292
00:19:52,500 --> 00:19:54,950
♪How can I keep my head clear♪

293
00:19:55,330 --> 00:19:59,660
♪But the moment you come close♪

294
00:20:00,160 --> 00:20:04,310
♪You burn through the
distance I fought to keep♪

295
00:20:04,810 --> 00:20:07,170
♪The lamplight flickers♪

296
00:20:07,170 --> 00:20:09,610
♪Like your eyes♪

297
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:13,110
♪Already written into my fate♪

298
00:20:28,860 --> 00:20:33,210
♪Something in my chest draws me near♪

299
00:20:33,570 --> 00:20:37,930
♪Like a silhouette, I move toward you♪

300
00:20:38,310 --> 00:20:42,730
♪The past lingers on,
yet my heart is in turmoil♪

301
00:20:43,070 --> 00:20:45,390
♪A test used as an excuse♪

302
00:20:45,390 --> 00:20:48,230
♪To stir the waters♪

303
00:20:48,230 --> 00:20:52,410
♪But the moment you come close♪

304
00:20:52,540 --> 00:20:57,280
♪You burn through the
distance I fought to keep♪

305
00:20:57,430 --> 00:20:59,780
♪The lamplight flickers♪

306
00:20:59,950 --> 00:21:02,210
♪Like your eyes♪

307
00:21:02,210 --> 00:21:06,670
♪Already written into my fate♪
